    \max_{b \in \mathcal{G}_K}
    \mathbb{E}\left[\sum_{t=1}^T r^H_t(b)\right]
    -
    \mathbb{E}\left[\sum_{t=1}^T r^H_t(a_t)\right].
\]
Let \(R^H(T)\) be the regret of the same learner in the original

